🧠 Overview

GOKU AI (V.3) represents a major architectural leap in Project Z — transforming the earlier single-service chatbot into a scalable, secure, microservices-driven AI platform.

This version introduces:

🔐 Secure authentication (JWT-based)

🧠 Memory-aware AI conversations

💳 Token-based billing enforcement

🤖 Pluggable AI engine (Gemini-ready)

🐳 Dockerized backend services

🌐 Fully wired professional frontend (Next.js)


Unlike earlier versions, V.3 is designed like a real-world AI product, not a prototype.


---

🎯 Core Vision

Build a long-term, extensible AI platform where:

Each persona has distinct behavior & memory

Conversations persist across sessions

AI usage is measured, limited, and enforceable

Backend services scale independently

Frontend securely integrates with backend APIs

The system is ready for cloud deployment



